```Title: PDF Reader Spawning a Shell or Script Host (CIM Endpoint.Processes)```
```ATT&CK: T1203 | Severity: high | Sigma id: 4c2f1e5d-e475-47f8-823d-e60eb809fb0e```
```Data source: CIM Endpoint.Processes data model. summariesonly=false works without acceleration; set true once the data model is accelerated.```
```False positives: PDF forms or plug-ins that launch scripts by design (rare)```
```Suggested ES correlation search: cron */15 * * * *, earliest=-20m@m latest=-5m@m, throttle on the table fields, notable severity high.```
| tstats summariesonly=false allow_old_summaries=true fillnull_value="null" count min(_time) as firstTime max(_time) as lastTime
    from datamodel=Endpoint.Processes
    where Processes.parent_process_name IN ("AcroRd32.exe", "Acrobat.exe", "FoxitPDFReader.exe", "FoxitReader.exe") Processes.process_name IN ("cmd.exe", "powershell.exe", "pwsh.exe", "wscript.exe", "cscript.exe", "mshta.exe", "rundll32.exe", "regsvr32.exe")
    by Processes.process Processes.dest Processes.process_current_directory Processes.process_path Processes.process_integrity_level Processes.original_file_name Processes.parent_process Processes.parent_process_path Processes.parent_process_guid Processes.parent_process_id Processes.process_guid Processes.process_id Processes.user
| rename Processes.* as *
| convert timeformat="%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%S" ctime(firstTime)
| convert timeformat="%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%S" ctime(lastTime)
